{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c01dd2cb-4c87-8f12-969d-8532f71f047e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T10:19:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance, parking violations, this is Luis. Happy day after Christmas."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:16:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi, yes, good morning. I got a parking ticket and I want to contest it, and I'm not sure how that, um, how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number, or your plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, I have it right here. It's on my, hold on, it's under the, [pause] sorry, the number is, um,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Actually, I can look it up by plate if that's easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the plate, yes. It's, wait, you said something, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go ahead, you were giving me the plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, sorry, there's a little delay on my phone, I keep talking over you. It's [crosstalk] okay, it's seven four one, Romeo Kilo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven four one R K. Got it, hang on a second. [pause] Okay, I see one ticket from last Monday, on Ayrault Street, expired meter. That the one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. I live at 289 Ayrault, so I thought, well, I don't know what I thought. Ha. Anyway, how do I contest it? What happens, is there a hearing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:17:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. You can request a hearing, in writing or in person, and then you'll get a date. You show up, tell your side, bring anything that backs it up, photos, a receipt, whatever you've got. A hearing officer decides."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:18:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A hearing officer, okay. And is that a, is it like a courtroom or, sorry, you're still talking, go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's pretty informal. It's a small room, not a courtroom. Ten, fifteen minutes usually."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh good, good. And, um, if I lose, or if I just decide to pay it, is there a payment plan? Can I split it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a single ticket, it's normally just paid in full. If you've got a pile of unpaid ones, there can be options, but I'd have to have someone in the office talk you through that. You only have the one on file."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the one, yes. Okay, so no plan for now. Ha, I lost my train of thought, what was I, oh, the hearing. Where do I send the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to the parking violations office here at City Hall. Put your ticket number and plate on it, and your phone number so they can reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, my number is 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, one-nine-three. I'll note it on the ticket too. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:19:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Thank you, Luis, that was clearer than I expected. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:19:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Enjoy the long weekend."
    }
  ],
